141 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 342 0 R
/E (The increasing sophistication and adaptability of APT campaigns has rendered traditional security mechanisms largely ineffective. Modern attack toolkits employ anti-forensics, living-off-the-land techniques, and encrypted command-and-control channels to blend seamlessly into legitimate enterprise traffic.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
142 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 343 0 R
/E (Current Intrusion Detection Systems are constrained to catalogued threats; zero-day exploits are entirely invisible. Enterprise activity volumes cause alert fatigue, masking genuine threats among noise.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
143 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 344 0 R
/E (Sequential log parsing discards structural and temporal relationships between entities. Real-time analysis of millions of daily audit events exceeds deployed system capacity.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
